{
  "_doc": "Image repository -> upstream advisory sources for stacks/advisory-watch. Keys are image references without tag/digest, docker.io/ and library/ stripped. Fields: github (owner/repo, GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/security-advisories), osv {ecosystem, package} (POST api.osv.dev/v1/query with the pinned version), nvd_cpe (string or list, NVD CVE API 2.0), feed (RSS/Atom URL, security items only), local (built here; base = the catalog key of its FROM image), tag_is_version (default true; false for wrapper images whose tag is not the upstream product version, so the verdict stays Unknown), feed_filter (regex on feed item titles), confirm (mapping not verified by a human yet), note. scripts/advisory-catalog-check.py fails CI when an image in stacks/ has no entry. See stacks/advisory-watch/README.md.",
